# Staged build-time inputs for the suburb adapters (suburb-adapter-workflow.md).
#
# COMMITTED here: vpsr-median-*.xls (VIC price) and lsg_stats_*.xlsx (SA price). They
# are small AND non-refetchable by automation — VPSR is Cloudflare-walled and
# data.sa.gov.au 403s every programmatic client — so pinning the file in git is the
# only way to reproduce the build. (No ignore line: they don't match the patterns below.)
#
# IGNORED: the CSA Victoria crime workbooks (Data_Tables_*.xlsx, ~18 MB each). Unlike
# VPSR, the CSA file host (files.crimestatistics.vic.gov.au) is openly reachable, so
# the input is refetchable from the URL recorded in README.md — no need to carry the
# weight in git. Re-download into this dir before re-running `suburbs.csa_vic`.
Data_Tables_*.xlsx
#
# IGNORED: the QLD crime CSV (qps) — 21 MB from data.qld.gov.au (AWS-WAF-walled, but
# refetchable via a browser; refetch URL in README.md). Re-download before `suburbs.qps`.
*_Reported_Offences_Number.csv
